@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
left to right direction
title 用例图：实际角色权限
actor "系统用户" as User
actor "管理员" as Admin
actor "项目经理" as Manager
actor "财务" as Finance
actor "设计师" as Designer
User <|-- Admin
User <|-- Manager
User <|-- Finance
User <|-- Designer
rectangle "装修公司管理系统" {
  usecase "登录 / 退出" as Login
  usecase "查看经营看板" as Dashboard
  usecase "查看项目" as ViewProject
  usecase "客户、项目、施工阶段维护" as Work
  usecase "供应商、材料采购维护" as Supply
  usecase "查看员工" as ViewEmployee
  usecase "员工维护" as Employee
  usecase "账号维护 / 密码重置" as Account
  usecase "查看收款" as ViewPayment
  usecase "收款维护" as Payment
}
User -- Login
User -- Dashboard
User -- ViewProject
Admin -- Work
Manager -- Work
Designer -- Work
Admin -- Supply
Manager -- Supply
Admin -- ViewEmployee
Manager -- ViewEmployee
Admin -- Employee
Admin -- Account
Admin -- ViewPayment
Manager -- ViewPayment
Finance -- ViewPayment
Admin -- Payment
Finance -- Payment
note bottom of Work
维护含查看、新增、修改、删除。
已登录且具有相应权限为业务用例前置条件。
登录不作为每次业务操作的 include 子用例。
end note
@enduml
